Natphimon_Amato_ITAI1371-Intro-to-Machine-Learning

This repository contains materials, assignments, and projects for ITAI1371 – Introduction to Machine Learning. 
The course focuses on the fundamental concepts, algorithms, and applications of machine learning, 
providing with both theoretical understanding and practical experience.

Machine learning is a subfield of artificial intelligence that enables computers to learn from data 
and improve our performance over time without being explicitly programmed. 
Through this course, I will explore key topics such as supervised and unsupervised learning, model evaluation, 
feature selection, and neural networks.

The repository includes:
* Lecture notes and reference materials
* Example code implementations in Python
* Homework assignments and project submissions
* Datasets used for analysis and experimentation
